@name prop-brazier
@scale 14
@size 16x24
# A wrought-iron tripod brazier of the kind that lights a Waterdhavian temple
# porch or a Zhentarim guardroom: a wide riveted dish on a knotted collar, three
# splayed legs, a bed of coals. Humanoid-sized (16x24, feet on row 23), so it
# stands on a tile the way a person does.
#
# Seen from above and in front, like everything in this world: the dish's
# mouth is an ellipse full of coals, walled by its inner face -- concave, so
# the far RIGHT inner wall catches the upper-left light and the left one is in
# shade -- above a bright front lip and a convex body lit on the left.
#
# Authored as a stack: `stand` and `bowl` are drawn once and repeated by the
# later frames (a @layer with no rows), only `coals` animates -- a slow pulse,
# because coals breathe while a flame dances. Put fx-torch-flame on top at
# @point flame; the coals share the flame's @ramp, so @recolor gives
# prop-brazier-radiant / -necrotic / -cold coals that match a recoloured flame.
@anchor 8,24
@point flame 7,10
@point light 7,5
@ramp iron iron 5 abcde
@ramp fire fire 5 01234
@recolor fire magic
@palette
K #1d1b24 outline
@lint skip=stray emissive=fire

@frame glow-0 dur=240
@layer stand at=0,16
......KcaK......
.....KdcbaK.....
....Kc.ca.bK....
....Kc.ca.bK....
...Kc..ca..bK...
...Kc..ca..bK...
..Kc...ca...bK..
.Kcb..KcaK..baK.
@layer bowl at=0,6
....KKKKKKKK....
..KKab0000cdKK..
.Keb00000000dcK.
Keb0000000000dcK
Kea0000000000dbK
KdeeeddddcccbbaK
.KcdcbbbbbbbbaK.
..KcdbebbbebaK..
...KcdbbbbbaK...
....KKcbbaKK....
@layer coals at=3,7
...1021...
.02130120.
1203423021
0121302120

@frame glow-1 dur=200
@layer stand
@layer bowl
@layer coals at=3,7
...1031...
.03140130.
1304434031
0131403130

@frame glow-2 dur=260
@layer stand
@layer bowl
@layer coals at=3,7
...1021...
.02120120.
1202322021
0121202120
